剧本基本上完工，继续打磨剧情内容，
模组上正在进行可玩性演出的编辑，
美工和音乐仍然是一项巨大的挑战，
同时今天对个人网页进行了大更新，正在上传一些模组更新内容，&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are some achievements from July.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The script is essentially complete, and we&amp;rsquo;re continuing to refine the storyline.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&amp;rsquo;re currently editing gameplay sequences for the mod.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artwork and music remain significant challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Meanwhile, I&amp;rsquo;ve made a major update to my personal website and am uploading some mod updates.&lt;/p&gt;
